        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Atahualpa</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 1502 CE – 1533 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 1502, place disputed: <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cusco">Cusco</a> by the chroniclers Cieza de León and Betanzos, Caranqui or <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/quito">Quito</a> by other accounts and by his own statement before his death; son of the emperor Huayna Cápac</span></div>
