          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Who they were</span><span class="info-stat-val">Governor of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/quito">Quito</a> under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/huascar">Huáscar</a>; leader of the northern side in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/inca-empire">Inca</a> Civil War (1529–1532); <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sapa-inca">Sapa Inca</a> from April 1532, with the regnal name Caccha Pachacuti Inca Yupanqui Inca; a prisoner of the Spaniards from November 1532</span></div>
